{
  "surah": 88,
  "translation": "en-arberry",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "text": "Hast thou received the story of the Enveloper?"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "text": "Faces on that day humbled,"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "text": "labouring, toilworn,"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "text": "roasting at a scorching fire,"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "text": "watered at a boiling fountain,"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "text": "no food for them but cactus thorn"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "text": "unfattening, unappeasing hunger."
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "text": "Faces on that day jocund,"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "text": "with their striving well-pleased,"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "text": "in a sublime Garden,"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "text": "hearing there no babble;"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "text": "therein a running fountain,"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "text": "therein uplifted couches"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "text": "and goblets set forth"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "text": "and cushions arrayed"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "text": "and carpets outspread."
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "text": "What, do they not consider how the camel was created,"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "text": "how heaven was lifted up,"
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "text": "how the mountains were hoisted,"
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "text": "how the earth was outstretched?"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "text": "Then remind them! Thou art only a reminder;"
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "text": "thou art not charged to oversee them."
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "text": "But he who turns his back, and disbelieves,"
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "text": "God shall chastise him with the greatest chastisement."
    },
    {
      "number": 25,
      "text": "Truly, to Us is their return;"
    },
    {
      "number": 26,
      "text": "then upon Us shall rest their reckoning."
    }
  ]
}